OL,3,GNEWSACall to scrap States vote on
OL,4,Agovernment priorities
OL,5,
OL,6,FA backbench States member has called
OL,7,Ffor changes to the way Jersey's
OL,8,Fgovernment priorities are debated,
OL,9,Farguing politicians should no longer be
OL,10,Fasked to formally approve a plan they
OL,11,Fhad little role in creating.
OL,13,FDeputy Hilary Jeune has lodged a
OL,14,Fproposition to change how the Common
OL,15,FStrategic Policy (CSP), the document
OL,16,Fsetting out the Council of Ministers'
OL,17,Fpriorities for the next four years, is
OL,18,Fhandled by the States Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
