OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall to scrap States vote on
OL,4,Agovernment priorities
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the proposal, the CSP would still
OL,7,Fbe produced by ministers and
OL,8,Fscrutinised but, instead of requiring a
OL,9,FStates vote, it would be presented as a
OL,10,Freport and debated by members
OL,11,Fin-committee, without approval being
OL,12,Fsought.
OL,14,FMinisters would also have to publish an
OL,15,Fannual progress report by 31 January
OL,16,Feach year and discuss it with the
OL,17,Fassembly.
